MACRO 1 PREF WORK '*' PROC '*'                                                  
* *                                                                             
* *    W W D I S T 7 9                                                          
* *                                                                             
* *        TEST AV DISTRIKT                                                     
* *                                                                             
* *    U S A G E :                                                              
* *                                                                             
* *        THIS COPYTEXT IS A DUAL-PURPOSE COPYTEXT. IF COULD BE USED           
* *    JUST TO DEFINE DISTRICT CONSTANTS, AND/OR COULD BE USED AS A             
* *    PROCEDURE TO CHECK DISTRICT GROUPS.                                      
* *        IF THIS COPYTEXT IS NEEDED IN EPLUST PROGRAM, THEN THERE             
* *    MUST BE ATLEAST ONE DEFINITION IN THE WORKING STORAGE  AREA,LIKE         
* *    THIS...                                                                  
* *              %WWDIST79  REQUIRED-PREFIX  WORK ''                            
* *                                                                             
* *        IF DISTRICT GROUPS ARE TO BE TESTED, THE COPYTEXT HAS TO BE          
* *     AS ...                                                                  
* *              %WWDIST79  REQUIRED-PREFIX  PROC ''                            
* *                                                                             
* *     AT THE END OF THE JOB AND THE PROCEDURE IN THE COPYTEXT CAN BE          
* *     CALLED FROM ANYWHERE IN THE JOB LIKE...                                 
* *                                                                             
* *              PERFORM S75-TEST-DIST79                                        
* *                                                                             
* *     I M P O R T A N T :                                                     
* *                                                                             
* *       - WHEN DEFINING NEW FIELDS IN THIS COPYTEXT,THE &&WORK FIELD          
* *         MUST BE USED AT COLUMN 1.                                           
* *       - WHEN ADDING NEW DISTRICT GROUP PROCEDURES TO THIS COPYTEXT,         
* *         THE &&PROC FIELD MUST BE USED AT COLUMN 1.                          
* *       - WHEN ANY CHANGES ARE DONE, ALL THE EPLUS PROGRAMS THAT USE          
* *         THIS COPYTEXT MUST BE RECOMPILED.                                   
* *                                                                             
* *     E R R O R S :                                                           
* *                                                                             
* *       IN CASE OF ANY COMPILATATION ERRORS, PLEASE CHECK IF THE              
* *     CORRECT VALUES ARE PASSED TO THE &&WORK AND &&PREF PARAMETERS.          
* *     THE ONLY VALID VALUE FOR THESE PARAMETERS ARE ''.                       
* *                                                                             
                                                                                
* *                                                                             
* *  DISTRICT CONSTANT DEFINITIONS.                                             
* *                                                                             
&WORK DEFINE DIST79-DEALER-PRICE         W  1    A  VALUE  'N'                  
                                                                                
* *                                                                             
* *  DISTRICT GROUP TESTING PROCEDURES.                                         
* *                                                                             
&PROC.S75-TEST-DIST79. PROC                                                     
&PROC DIST79-DEALER-PRICE      = 'N'                                            
&PROC IF &PREF.IDDISTR   EQ  0778                 +                             
&PROC                        0870 0878            +                             
&PROC                        0970 0974 0978       +                             
&PROC                        1258                 +                             
&PROC                        1378                 +                             
&PROC                        1420 1478            +                             
&PROC                        1678                 +                             
&PROC                        1778                 +                             
&PROC                        1822 1870 1871       +                             
&PROC                        1958                 +                             
&PROC                        2078                 +                             
&PROC                        2120 2178            +                             
&PROC                        2278                 +                             
&PROC                        2364 2365            +                             
&PROC                        2370 THRU 2378       +                             
&PROC                        8038 8039            +                             
&PROC                        8092                 +                             
&PROC                        8802 8807            +                             
&PROC                        8851 8857 8859       +                             
&PROC                        8886 8887 8888       +                             
&PROC                        8896 8897 8899                                     
&PROC   DIST79-DEALER-PRICE    = 'J'                                            
&PROC END-IF                                                                    
&PROC.END-PROC                                                                  
